flowchart TD
    A[links.service starts] --> B[ExecStartPre runs<br/>fetch-db-pass.sh]
    B --> C[curl IMDS<br/>169.254.169.254]
    C --> D[Bearer token scoped to<br/>vault.azure.net]
    D --> E[curl Key Vault REST<br/>GET DbAppPassword]
    E --> F{RBAC check:<br/>Key Vault Secrets User<br/>on vm-web-01 identity?}

    F -->|no| G[403<br/>service start fails]
    F -->|yes| H[Secret value returned<br/>over TLS]

    H --> I[Write DB_PASS to<br/>/run/links/db.env<br/>tmpfs, RAM only]
    I --> J[systemd stacks<br/>app.env then db.env<br/>later wins]
    J --> K[links.service running<br/>with DB_PASS in env]
    K --> L[Restart or reboot<br/>wipes the tmpfs file]
    L --> B

    style G fill:#fdecea,stroke:#c0392b,color:#7b241c
    style K fill:#e8f8ec,stroke:#2ea043,color:#14532d
